  "releaseNotes": "v2.0.0 - Major: Strongly-typed metadata support. BREAKING CHANGES: IPaginationMetadataFactory.CreateMetadata() now returns PaginationMeta instead of object; ApiResponse<T>.Ok() no longer accepts meta parameter (use ApiResponse<TData, TMeta>.Ok() instead). NEW FEATURES: Add ApiResponse<TData, TMeta> for strongly-typed metadata responses; Add NoMeta marker type; Add PaginationMeta class; Add WithMeta<TData, TMeta>() extension method. BACKWARD COMPATIBILITY: ApiResponse<T> continues to work; WithMeta<T>(object) overload maintained. See README for migration guide.",
